//
// Zodiac signs:  0=Aries  1=Taurus  2=Gemini   3=Cancer   4=Leo      5=Virgo
//                6=Libra  7=Scorpio  8=Sagittarius  9=Capricorn  10=Aquarius  11=Pisces
//
// Element from sign:  sign%4  →  0=Fire  1=Earth  2=Air  3=Water
// Quality from sign:  sign%3  →  0=Cardinal  1=Fixed  2=Mutable
// Mutable signs:  Gemini(2), Virgo(5), Sagittarius(8), Pisces(11)  → sign%3 == 2

